<title>SINGAPORE: Great River in $150 mln credit facility.</title>
<headline>Great River in $150 mln credit facility.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's garment maker P.T. Great River International signed a US$150 million syndicated revolving credit facility on Friday, a statement from lead underwriter Deutsche Morgan Grenfell (Singapore) Ltd said.</p>
<p>The facility is the single largest offshore debt syndication by P.T. Great River to date, it said.</p>
<p>The company plans to use the facility for refinancing and to finance its working capital requirements.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
